)','sensitive issues in sociotechnical systems. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK18'),(1112,32,'WK19','weekly_schedule',36,'Week 10: Developing Employability','Developing Employability. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','developing employability. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK19'),(1113,32,'WK20','weekly_schedule',37,'Week 10: Developing Your Employability','Developing Your Employability. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','developing your employability. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK20'),(1114,32,'WK21','weekly_schedule',38,'Week 11: Open Topic / Guest Lecture','Open Topic / Guest Lecture. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','open topic / guest lecture. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK21'),(1115,32,'WK22','weekly_schedule',39,'Week 11: Reflection on common issues in assignments','Reflection on common issues in assignments. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','reflection on common issues in assignments. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK22'),(1116,32,'WK23','weekly_schedule',40,'Week 12: Unit Review and Debrief','Unit Review and Debrief. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','unit review and debrief. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK23'),(1117,32,'WK24','weekly_schedule',41,'Week 12: Group Project Presentations','Group Project Presentations. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','group project presentations. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK24'),(1118,32,'WK25','weekly_schedule',42,'Week 13: Open Topic / Guest Lecture','Open Topic / Guest Lecture. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','open topic / guest lecture. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK25'),(1119,32,'WK26','weekly_schedule',43,'Week 13: Reflection Workshop','Reflection Workshop. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','reflection workshop. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK26'),(1120,33,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit will provide you with a detailed overview of the concepts and models used in doing business digitally via the Internet. These concepts and models will enable you to evaluate, synthesise and implement Internet-enabled business models. The unit will provide the critical link between the firm\'s performance and modern Internet technologies, such as e-Commerce platforms, Social Media and Social Networking. Emphasis will be put on the utilisation of Internet technologies to enable new forms of digital business, rather than on the technologies themselves. Assumed knowledge for this unit is INFS1000 or equivalent.','this unit will provide you with a detailed overview of the concepts and models used in doing business digitally via the internet. these concepts and models will enable you to evaluate, synthesise and implement internet-enabled business models. the unit will provide the critical link between the firm\'s performance and modern internet technologies, such as e-commerce platforms, social media and social networking. emphasis will be put on the utilisation of internet technologies to enable new forms of digital business, rather than on the technologies themselves. assumed knowledge for this unit is infs1000 or equivalent.','overview:OV01'),(1121,33,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. identify and analyse major current trends in conducting digital business and understand the key challenges in developing and managing businesses in online contexts','lo1. identify and analyse major current trends in conducting digital business and understand the key challenges in developing and managing businesses in online contexts','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1122,33,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. diagnose and solve business problems and design business solutions that can result in significant business improvement through the exploitation of information and communications technologies','lo2. diagnose and solve business problems and design business solutions that can result in significant business improvement through the exploitation of information and communications technologies','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1123,33,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. perform as effective team members in a variety of business contexts and act in a professional business manner as both members and leaders of teams, and in relation to client interactions','lo3. perform as effective team members in a variety of business contexts and act in a professional business manner as both members and leaders of teams, and in relation to client interactions','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1124,33,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. communicate a business plan in a clear and convincing manner both written and verbal','lo4. communicate a business plan in a clear and convincing manner both written and verbal','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1125,33,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. identify market opportunities and develop strategies to take advantage of them.','lo5. identify market opportunities and develop strategies to take advantage of them.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1126,33,'AS01','assessment',7,'Final exam Written exam with MCQ','Type: Written exam. Description: Final exam Written exam with MCQ','type: written exam. description: final exam written exam with mcq','assessment:AS01'),(1127,33,'AS02','assessment',8,'Early feedback quiz MCQ Early Feedback Task','Type: Out-of-class quiz. Description: Early feedback quiz MCQ Early Feedback Task','type: out-of-class quiz. description: early feedback quiz mcq early feedback task','assessment:AS02'),(1128,33,'AS03','assessment',9,'Mid-semester Quiz MCQ','Type: In-class quiz. Description: Mid-semester Quiz MCQ','type: in-class quiz. description: mid-semester quiz mcq','assessment:AS03'),(1129,33,'AS04','assessment',10,'Group project report Written report','Type: Written work. Description: Group project report Written report','type: written work. description: group project report written report','assessment:AS04'),(1130,33,'AS05','assessment',11,'Group project presentation Oral presentation','Type: Presentation. Description: Group project presentation Oral presentation','type: presentation. description: group project presentation oral presentation','assessment:AS05'),(1131,33,'AD01','assessment_description',12,'Assessment description 1','Early feedback quiz: This quiz will be based on the content delivered during weeks 1-2 of the semester. Students are required to attempt all questions.','early feedback quiz: this quiz will be based on the content delivered during weeks 1-2 of the semester. students are required to attempt all questions.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1132,33,'AD02','assessment_description',13,'Assessment description 2','Mid-semester exam: This exam will be based on the content delivered during weeks 3-5 of the semester. Students are required to attempt all questions.','mid-semester exam: this exam will be based on the content delivered during weeks 3-5 of the semester. students are required to attempt all questions.','assessment_description:AD02'),(1133,33,'AD03','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 3','Group project report: The group project is an applied assignment that involves the development of a business plan for a new product or service of your choice. You will outline the value proposition, define the key components of the digital business model, analyse competitive positioning, articulate the digital business capabilities required, and develop an implementation plan. Groups will submit a report that captures these elements.','group project report: the group project is an applied assignment that involves the development of a business plan for a new product or service of your choice. you will outline the value proposition, define the key components of the digital business model, analyse competitive positioning, articulate the digital business capabilities required, and develop an implementation plan. groups will submit a report that captures these elements.','assessment_description:AD03'),(1134,33,'AD04','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 4','Group project presentation: Each group will present its business plan during the lectures and tutorials in weeks 12 and 13. All group members must participate in the presentation.','group project presentation: each group will present its business plan during the lectures and tutorials in weeks 12 and 13. all group members must participate in the presentation.','assessment_description:AD04'),(1135,33,'AD05','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 5','Final exam: This is a closed-book exam that will cover material from all weekly classes and readings. This exam will consist of an extended answer, case study and multiple-choice questions.','final exam: this is a closed-book exam that will cover material from all weekly classes and readings. this exam will consist of an extended answer, case study and multiple-choice questions.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1136,33,'AD06','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 6','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD06'),(1137,33,'WK01','weekly_schedule',18,'Week 01: Introduction and unit overview','Introduction and unit overview. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','introduction and unit overview. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1138,33,'WK02','weekly_schedule',19,'Week 01: Introduction and unit overview','Introduction and unit overview. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','introduction and unit overview. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1139,33,'WK03','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 02: Digital economy','Digital economy. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','digital economy. learning acti