ality clauses that apply in the student deed poll)','assessment_description:AD13'),(1425,41,'AD14','assessment_description',27,'Assessment description 14','If you use these tools, you must be aware of their limitations, biases, and propensity for fabrication','if you use these tools, you must be aware of their limitations, biases, and propensity for fabrication','assessment_description:AD14'),(1426,41,'AD15','assessment_description',28,'Assessment description 15','Do not rely on the accuracy of outputs. You remain responsible for your work. This means you must independently verify and edit AI-generated content to ensure the integrity, accuracy, and suitability of the output','do not rely on the accuracy of outputs. you remain responsible for your work. this means you must independently verify and edit ai-generated content to ensure the integrity, accuracy, and suitability of the output','assessment_description:AD15'),(1427,41,'AD16','assessment_description',29,'Assessment description 16','While there are many AI tools available, both free and paid, we strongly recommend the use of tools endorsed by the University such as Microsoft Copilot, Cogniti and Adobe Firefly. For a list of AI tools and their uses, see the Different Generative AI Tools page on the AI in Education Canvas site.','while there are many ai tools available, both free and paid, we strongly recommend the use of tools endorsed by the university such as microsoft copilot, cogniti and adobe firefly. for a list of ai tools and their uses, see the different generative ai tools page on the ai in education canvas site.','assessment_description:AD16'),(1428,41,'AD17','assessment_description',30,'Assessment description 17','Where AI is used, you are advised to keep copies of the prompts you provided and AI outputs as evidence of your research and writing process. This allows you to produce an accurate acknowledgement of AI use when you submit your work, see guidance below. This can be requested by the unit coordinator if there is any uncertainty about the originality of your work.','where ai is used, you are advised to keep copies of the prompts you provided and ai outputs as evidence of your research and writing process. this allows you to produce an accurate acknowledgement of ai use when you submit your work, see guidance below. this can be requested by the unit coordinator if there is any uncertainty about the originality of your work.','assessment_description:AD17'),(1429,41,'AD18','assessment_description',31,'Assessment description 18','Acknowledging the use of AI','acknowledging the use of ai','assessment_description:AD18'),(1430,41,'AD19','assessment_description',32,'Assessment description 19','It is not appropriate to copy-paste AI-generated responses directly as part of your own writing since the work you submit should reflect the understanding you have acquired, your critical engagement with the material and your process of continuous revision and improvement.','it is not appropriate to copy-paste ai-generated responses directly as part of your own writing since the work you submit should reflect the understanding you have acquired, your critical engagement with the material and your process of continuous revision and improvement.','assessment_description:AD19'),(1431,41,'AD20','assessment_description',33,'Assessment description 20','Where AI is used, you are advised to keep copies of the prompts you provided and AI outputs as evidence of your research and writing process. This allows you to produce an accurate acknowledgement of AI use when you submit your work, see wording below. This can be requested by the unit coordinator if there is any uncertainty about the originality of your work.','where ai is used, you are advised to keep copies of the prompts you provided and ai outputs as evidence of your research and writing process. this allows you to produce an accurate acknowledgement of ai use when you submit your work, see wording below. this can be requested by the unit coordinator if there is any uncertainty about the originality of your work.','assessment_description:AD20'),(1432,41,'AD21','assessment_description',34,'Assessment description 21','You must acknowledge any uses of AI by inserting a note at the end of your submission where you need to describe the tool(s) that you used, what prompt(s) you provided, how the output of the artificial intelligence was used or adapted by you, and how you verified sources or information if applicable. This additional description does not add to your word count. An example of such an acknowledgement that you may provide might look like:','you must acknowledge any uses of ai by inserting a note at the end of your submission where you need to describe the tool(s) that you used, what prompt(s) you provided, how the output of the artificial intelligence was used or adapted by you, and how you verified sources or information if applicable. this additional description does not add to your word count. an example of such an acknowledgement that you may provide might look like:','assessment_description:AD21'),(1433,41,'AD22','assessment_description',35,'Assessment description 22','I acknowledge the use of ChatGPT (https://chat.openai.com/) to refine the academic language of my own work. On date I submitted my entire essay (link to original document here) with the prompt to <“Improve the academic tone and accuracy of language, including grammatical structures, punctuation and vocabulary”>. The output (link here) was then modified further to better represent my own tone and style of writing. One of the limitations I noted was insert limitation and I revised my assessment to address this limitation by insert response.','i acknowledge the use of chatgpt (https://chat.openai.com/) to refine the academic language of my own work. on date i submitted my entire essay (link to original document here) with the prompt to <“improve the academic tone and accuracy of language, including grammatical structures, punctuation and vocabulary”>. the output (link here) was then modified further to better represent my own tone and style of writing. one of the limitations i noted was insert limitation and i revised my assessment to address this limitation by insert response.','assessment_description:AD22'),(1434,41,'AD23','assessment_description',36,'Assessment description 23','Please note, your project supervisor may require you to provide a written statement if you would like to use AI heavily in your work, (i.e. for multiple approved uses above or heavy use within any individual use categories), a different approach may be needed including clearly stating the percentage of work attributed to AI for each assessment. If you are unsure or have any concerns, please discuss these with your Project Supervisor in advance. In all cases, individual group members must be transparent with their group members about intended use of generative AI in groupwork.','please note, your project supervisor may require you to provide a written statement if you would like to use ai heavily in your work, (i.e. for multiple approved uses above or heavy use within any individual use categories), a different approach may be needed including clearly stating the percentage of work attributed to ai for each assessment. if you are unsure or have any concerns, please discuss these with your project supervisor in advance. in all cases, individual group members must be transparent with their group members about intended use of generative ai in groupwork.','assessment_description:AD23'),(1435,41,'WK01','weekly_schedule',37,'Weekly: See Canvas site for detailed project schedule','See Canvas site for detailed project schedule. Learning activity: Lecture (1 hr)','see canvas site for detailed project schedule. learning activity: lecture (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1436,41,'WK02','weekly_schedule',38,'Weekly: See Canvas site for detailed project schedule','See Canvas site for detailed project schedule. Learning activity: Tutorial (2 hr)','see canvas site for detailed project schedule. learning activity: tutorial (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1437,42,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit provides students with the opportunity to address complex problems identified by industry, community, and government organisations. With mentorship from a major industry partner and an academic lead, students integrate their academic skills and knowledge by working in diverse teams across disciplinary boundaries. Students research, analyse and present solutions to a real-world problem, and build on their interpersonal and transferable skills by engaging with and learning from experts in the field. See the ICPU website for further information here: https://www.sydney.edu.au/students/industry-and-community-projects.html.','this unit provides students with the opportunity to address complex problems identified by industry, community, and government organisations. with mentorship from a major industry partner and an academic lead, students integrate their academic skills and knowledge by working in diverse teams across disciplinary boundaries. students research, analyse and present solutions to a real-world problem, and build on their interpersonal and transferable skills by engaging with and learning from experts in the field. see the icpu website for further information here: https://www.sydney.edu.au/students/industry-and-community-projects.html.','overview:OV01'),(1438,42,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Demonstrate critical awareness of, and apply, disciplinary knowledge, skills and personal attributes to address complex real-world problems','lo1. demonstrate critical awareness of, and apply, disciplinary knowledge, skills and personal attributes to address complex real-world problems','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1439,42,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Assess and integrate diverse stakeholder perspectives to generate innovative insights into complex problems','lo2. assess and integrate diverse stakeholder perspectives to generate innovative insights into complex problems','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1440,42,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Purposefully select and apply complex problem-solving approaches and methods','lo3. purposefully select and apply complex problem-solving approaches and methods','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1441,42,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Communicate novel ideas effectively and persuasively in professional settings using relevant media','lo4. communicate novel ideas effectively and persuasively in professional settings using relevant media','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1442,42,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Demonstrate professionalism (proficiency, adaptivity, and proactivity) in collaborative project work','lo5. demonstrate professionalism (proficiency, adaptivity, and proactivity) in collaborative project work','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1443,42,'AS01','assessment',7,'Participation Compulsory 90% class participation','Type: Contribution. Description: Participation Compulsory 90% class participation','type: contribution. description: participation compulsory 90% class participation','assessment:AS01'),(1444,42,'AS02','assessment',8,'Individual Statement Instalment 1 Written task','Type: Portfolio or journal. Description: Individual Statement Instalment 1 Written task','type: portfolio or journal. description: individual statement instalment 1 written task','assessment:AS02'),(1445,42,'AS03','assessment',9,'Group Plan Research plan','Type: Written work. Description: Group Plan Research plan','type: written work. description: group plan research plan','assessment:AS03'),(1446,42,'AS04','assessment',10,'Group Presentation Oral presentation inclusive of 300-word or equivalent Executive summary','Type: Presentation. Description: Group Presentation Oral presentation inclusive of 300-word or equivalent Executive summary','type: presentation. description: group presentation oral presentation inclusive of 300-word or equivalent executive summary','assessment:AS04'),(1447,42,'AS05','assessment',11,'Individual Statement Instalment 2 Written task','Type: Portfolio or journal. Description: Individual Statement Instalment 2 Written task','type: portfolio or journal. description: individual statement instalment 2 written task','assessment:AS05'),(1448,42,'AS06','assessment',12,'Group Project Report Report','Type: Written work. Description: Group Project Report Report','type: written work. description: group project report report','assessment:AS06'),(1449,42,'AS07','assessment',13,'Group Work Survey Questionnaire','Type: Evaluation. Description: Group Work Survey Questionnaire','type: evaluation. description: group work survey questionnaire','assessment:AS07'),(1450,42,'AD01','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 1','Individual Statements aims to analyse and reflect on students’ own and other members’ ways of contributing to their work on this project.','individual statements aims to analyse and reflect on students\' own and other members\' ways of contributing to their work on this project.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1451,42,'AD02','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 2','Group Plan aims to articulate the issues the group will address and develop a project plan.','group plan aims to articulate the issues the group will address and develop a project plan.','assessment_description:AD02'),(1452,42,'AD03','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 3','Group Presentation including Executive Summary aims to present students’ work and findings to the project partner.','group presentation including executive summary aims to present students\' work and findings to the project partner.','assessment_description:AD03'),(1453,42,'AD04','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 4','Group Project Report aims to conduct in depth analysis/es and research, discuss the results, and provide recommendations or solutions to the issues outlined in the group plan.','group project report aims to conduct in depth analysis/es and research, discuss the results, and provide recommendations or solutions to the issues outlined in the group plan.','assessment_description:AD04'),(1454,42,'AD05','assessment_description',18,'Assessment description 5','Group Work Survey aims to evaluate student’s contributions relative to the contributions of other team members.','group work survey aims to evaluate student\'s contributions relative to the contributions of other team members.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1455,42,'AD06','assessment_description',19,'Assessment description 6','Participation aims to ensure active participation by all team members for the project work.','participation aims to ensure active participation by all team members for the project work.','assessment_description:AD06'),(1456,42,'AD07','assessment_description',20,'Assessment description 7','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD07'),(1457,42,'AD08','assessment_description',21,'Assessment description 8','Individual contributions to group assessments may adjust the final grade that a student receives, through what is known as a Relative Performance Factor. Please see Canvas Assignment page for more details.','individual contributions to group assessments may adjust the final grade that a student receives, through what is known as a relative performance factor. please see canvas assignment page for more details.','assessment_description:AD08'),(1458,42,'AD09','assessment_description',22,'Assessment description 9','Using AI in ICPU','using ai in icpu','assessment_description:AD09'),(1459,42,'AD10','assessment_description',23,'Assessment description 10','The Use of Generative AI across multiple sectors of work is increasing ex