e',22,'Week 05: Solution Objective','Solution Objective. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','solution objective. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1527,44,'WK06','weekly_schedule',23,'Week 06: Prototyping and Storytelling','Prototyping and Storytelling. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','prototyping and storytelling. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1528,44,'WK07','weekly_schedule',24,'Week 07: Outsourcing and Automation','Outsourcing and Automation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','outsourcing and automation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1529,44,'WK08','weekly_schedule',25,'Week 08: IT Project Management','IT Project Management. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','it project management. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK08'),(1530,44,'WK09','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 09: Usability Engineering','Usability Engineering. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','usability engineering. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK09'),(1531,44,'WK10','weekly_schedule',27,'Week 10: Design Ethics','Design Ethics. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','design ethics. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK10'),(1532,44,'WK11','weekly_schedule',28,'Week 11: Scientific Writing','Scientific Writing. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','scientific writing. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(1533,44,'WK12','weekly_schedule',29,'Week 12: Unit Review and Debriefing','Unit Review and Debriefing. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','unit review and debriefing. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1534,44,'WK13','weekly_schedule',30,'Week 13: Project presentations','Project presentations. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','project presentations. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1535,45,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit introduces students to the foundations of business information systems and the emerging strategic role of information and communication technologies (ICT) in transforming organisations. Students develop an understanding of how ICT come to matter to organisations as they disrupt, change and transform organisations and organisational processes. The unit covers systems issues, information literacy and use, and how various digital technologies work together to create an infrastructure for digital business and how technologies (such as social media) are disrupting \'business as usual\'. The role of information systems in capturing and distributing organisational knowledge and in enhancing decision-making is explored. Students gain an understanding of socio-technical networks, how information systems function, and how processes in organisations can be leveraged to create digital innovation and business transformation.','this unit introduces students to the foundations of business information systems and the emerging strategic role of information and communication technologies (ict) in transforming organisations. students develop an understanding of how ict come to matter to organisations as they disrupt, change and transform organisations and organisational processes. the unit covers systems issues, information literacy and use, and how various digital technologies work together to create an infrastructure for digital business and how technologies (such as social media) are disrupting \'business as usual\'. the role of information systems in capturing and distributing organisational knowledge and in enhancing decision-making is explored. students gain an understanding of socio-technical networks, how information systems function, and how processes in organisations can be leveraged to create digital innovation and business transformation.','overview:OV01'),(1536,45,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Interpret, analyze, model and visualize representations of business processes, organisational structures and data.','lo1. interpret, analyze, model and visualize representations of business processes, organisational structures and data.','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1537,45,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Appraise and critically assess the use of digital technology in business, society and individual workplace contexts.','lo2. appraise and critically assess the use of digital technology in business, society and individual workplace contexts.','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1538,45,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Effectively communicate and collaborate with different personalities, individually and in group settings, incomplex digital work environments to achieve positive and sustainable change outcomes.','lo3. effectively communicate and collaborate with different personalities, individually and in group settings, incomplex digital work environments to achieve positive and sustainable change outcomes.','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1539,45,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Evaluate the operations of a business and suggest and design solutions and improvements enabled by digital technology.','lo4. evaluate the operations of a business and suggest and design solutions and improvements enabled by digital technology.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1540,45,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Identify current trends in business information systems and ability to assess their implications for managers, organisations, employees and other stakeholders.','lo5. identify current trends in business information systems and ability to assess their implications for managers, organisations, employees and other stakeholders.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1541,45,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Appraise and Examine the problem space within which technology is used with the aim to argue for the design of a specific solution','lo6. appraise and examine the problem space within which technology is used with the aim to argue for the design of a specific solution','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1542,45,'AS01','assessment',8,'End of Semester Reflective Essay An end of semester reflection on the unit learning. For details see Canvas.','Type: Written work. Description: End of Semester Reflective Essay An end of semester reflection on the unit learning. For details see Canvas.','type: written work. description: end of semester reflective essay an end of semester reflection on the unit learning. for details see canvas.','assessment:AS01'),(1543,45,'AS02','assessment',9,'Participation Individual, see canvas for details','Type: Contribution. Description: Participation Individual, see canvas for details','type: contribution. description: participation individual, see canvas for details','assessment:AS02'),(1544,45,'AS03','assessment',10,'Reflection on Group Work Provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','Type: Evaluation. Description: Reflection on Group Work Provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','type: evaluation. description: reflection on group work provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','assessment:AS03'),(1545,45,'AS04','assessment',11,'Group Project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','Type: Portfolio or journal. Description: Group Project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','type: portfolio or journal. description: group project design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see canvas.','assessment:AS04'),(1546,45,'AS05','assessment',12,'Group project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','Type: Presentation. Description: Group project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','type: presentation. description: group project design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see canvas.','assessment:AS05'),(