 to clients.. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1561,46,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit introduces students to the foundations of business information systems and the emerging strategic role of information and communication technologies (ICT) in transforming organisations. Students develop an understanding of how ICT come to matter to organisations as they disrupt, change and transform organisations and organisational processes. The unit covers systems issues, information literacy and use, and how various digital technologies work together to create an infrastructure for digital business and how technologies (such as social media) are disrupting \'business as usual\'. The role of information systems in capturing and distributing organisational knowledge and in enhancing decision-making is explored. Students gain an understanding of socio-technical networks, how information systems function, and how processes in organisations can be leveraged to create digital innovation and business transformation.','this unit introduces students to the foundations of business information systems and the emerging strategic role of information and communication technologies (ict) in transforming organisations. students develop an understanding of how ict come to matter to organisations as they disrupt, change and transform organisations and organisational processes. the unit covers systems issues, information literacy and use, and how various digital technologies work together to create an infrastructure for digital business and how technologies (such as social media) are disrupting \'business as usual\'. the role of information systems in capturing and distributing organisational knowledge and in enhancing decision-making is explored. students gain an understanding of socio-technical networks, how information systems function, and how processes in organisations can be leveraged to create digital innovation and business transformation.','overview:OV01'),(1562,46,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Interpret, analyze, model and visualize representations of business processes, organisational structures and data.','lo1. interpret, analyze, model and visualize representations of business processes, organisational structures and data.','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1563,46,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Appraise and critically assess the use of digital technology in business, society and individual workplace contexts.','lo2. appraise and critically assess the use of digital technology in business, society and individual workplace contexts.','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1564,46,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Effectively communicate and collaborate with different personalities, individually and in group settings, incomplex digital work environments to achieve positive and sustainable change outcomes.','lo3. effectively communicate and collaborate with different personalities, individually and in group settings, incomplex digital work environments to achieve positive and sustainable change outcomes.','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1565,46,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Evaluate the operations of a business and suggest and design solutions and improvements enabled by digital technology.','lo4. evaluate the operations of a business and suggest and design solutions and improvements enabled by digital technology.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1566,46,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Identify current trends in business information systems and ability to assess their implications for managers, organisations, employees and other stakeholders.','lo5. identify current trends in business information systems and ability to assess their implications for managers, organisations, employees and other stakeholders.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1567,46,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Appraise and Examine the problem space within which technology is used with the aim to argue for the design of a specific solution','lo6. appraise and examine the problem space within which technology is used with the aim to argue for the design of a specific solution','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1568,46,'AS01','assessment',8,'End of Semester Reflective Essay An end of semester reflection on the unit learning. For details see Canvas.','Type: Written work. Description: End of Semester Reflective Essay An end of semester reflection on the unit learning. For details see Canvas.','type: written work. description: end of semester reflective essay an end of semester reflection on the unit learning. for details see canvas.','assessment:AS01'),(1569,46,'AS02','assessment',9,'Participation Individual, see canvas for details','Type: Contribution. Description: Participation Individual, see canvas for details','type: contribution. description: participation individual, see canvas for details','assessment:AS02'),(1570,46,'AS03','assessment',10,'Reflection on Group Work Provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','Type: Evaluation. Description: Reflection on Group Work Provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','type: evaluation. description: reflection on group work provide and respond to feedback on the performance of team members.','assessment:AS03'),(1571,46,'AS04','assessment',11,'Group Project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','Type: Portfolio or journal. Description: Group Project Design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see Canvas.','type: portfolio or journal. description: group project design proposal for system, with weekly formative submissions, see canvas.','assessment:AS04'),(1572,46,'AS05','assessment',12,'Group project Presentation Each team should offer a 3-minute proposal presentation followed by a 5-minute Q&A. see Canvas.','Type: Presentation. Description: Group project Presentation Each team should offer a 3-minute proposal presentation followed by a 5-minute Q&A. see Canvas.','type: presentation. description: group project presentation each team should offer a 3-minute proposal presentation followed by a 5-minute q&a. see canvas.','assessment:AS05'),(1573,46,'AD01','assessment_description',13,'Assessment description 1','For details on assessments please see the assessment section and details provided on the Unit’s Canvas site.','for details on assessments please see the assessment section and details provided on the unit\'s canvas site.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1574,46,'WK01','weekly_schedule',14,'Week 01: Introduction to Foundation in Digital Business; BIS as Technology','Introduction to Foundation in Digital Business; BIS as Technology. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','introduction to foundation in digital business; bis as technology. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1575,46,'WK02','weekly_schedule',15,'Week 02: BIS as Disruption; BIS as Transformation; BIS as Project','BIS as Disruption; BIS as Transformation; BIS as Project. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as disruption; bis as transformation; bis as project. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1576,46,'WK03','weekly_schedule',16,'Week 03: BIS as Tool; BIS as Information; Workshop - Information Searching','BIS as Tool; BIS as Information; Workshop - Information Searching. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as tool; bis as information; workshop - information searching. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1577,46,'WK04','weekly_schedule',17,'Week 04: Workshop - Design Thinking','Workshop - Design Thinking. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','workshop - design thinking. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1578,46,'WK05','weekly_schedule',18,'Week 05: BIS as System; BIS as System Dynamic','BIS as System; BIS as System Dynamic. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as system; bis as system dynamic. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1579,46,'WK06','weekly_schedule',19,'Week 06: BIS as System Thinking; BIS as Designed','BIS as System Thinking; BIS as Designed. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as system thinking; bis as designed. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1580,46,'WK07','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 07: BIS and IT; BIS as Data; Workshop - Data Flow Diagrams','BIS and IT; BIS as Data; Workshop - Data Flow Diagrams. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis and it; bis as data; workshop - data flow diagrams. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1581,46,'WK08','weekly_schedule',21,'Week 08: Self-directed study and consultation','Self-directed study and consultation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','self-directed study and consultation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK08'),(1582,46,'WK09','weekly_schedule',22,'Week 09: BIS as Workflow; Workshop - Introduction to BPMN; BIS as tool for efficiency','BIS as Workflow; Workshop - Introduction to BPMN; BIS as tool for efficiency. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as workflow; workshop - introduction to bpmn; bis as tool for efficiency. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK09'),(1583,46,'WK10','weekly_schedule',23,'Week 10: BIS as Decision; BIS as Insight','BIS as Decision; BIS as Insight. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis as decision; bis as insight. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK10'),(1584,46,'WK11','weekly_schedule',24,'Week 11: BIS and Ethics; BIS as Developed','BIS and Ethics; BIS as Developed. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis and ethics; bis as developed. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(1585,46,'WK12','weekly_schedule',25,'Week 12: BIS and Sustainability; Summary and Farewell','BIS and Sustainability; Summary and Farewell. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bis and sustainability; summary and farewell. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1586,46,'WK13','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 13: Group Project pitch/presentation to clients.','Group Project pitch/presentation to clients.. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','group project pitch/presentation to clients.. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1587,47,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','Strategic Information Systems Sourcing has at its core the cost-effective sourcing and delivery of IS solutions with the aim of supporting and enabling business strategy. It covers the procurement of in-house systems, outsourcing strategies and third-party IS sourcing (for example from \'the cloud\'). The focus of this unit is on managerial decisions in relation to the design, implementation and delivery of an IS sourcing strategy, and the governance of IS sourcing solutions. Students develop knowledge of the concepts, tools and methodologies used in the negotiation and development of an IS sourcing strategy.','strategic information systems sourcing has at its core the cost-effective sourcing and delivery of is solutions with the aim of supporting and enabling business strategy. it covers the procurement of in-house systems, outsourcing strategies and third-party is sourcing (for example from \'the cloud\'). the focus of this unit is on managerial decisions in relation to the design, implementation and delivery of an is sourcing strategy, and the governance of is sourcing solutions. students develop knowledge of the concepts, tools and methodologies used in the negotiation and development of an is sourcing strategy.','overview:OV01'),(1588,47,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Evaluate opportunities for outsourcing IT services within a range of business settings.','lo1. evaluate opportunities for outsourcing it services within a range of business settings.','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1589,47,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Demonstrate your understanding of the range of available outsourced IT services by selecting suitable services for a set of provided business scenarios.','lo2. demonstrate your understanding of the range of available outsourced it services by selecting suitable services for a set of provided business scenarios.','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1590,47,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Demonstrate understanding of the theories related to outsourcing by applying them to evaluate various outsourcing scenarios.','lo3. demonstrate understanding of the theories related to outsourcing by applying them to evaluate various outsourcing scenarios.','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1591,47,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Evaluate strategic information systems sourcing decisions in a business setting.','lo4. evaluate strategic information systems sourcing decisions in a business setting.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1592,47,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Identify risks associated with outsourcing and describe the risk mitigation strategies that are commonly applied and suggest recommendations on suitable controls.','lo5. identify risks associated with outsourcing and describe the risk mitigation strategies that are commonly applied and suggest recommendations on suitable controls.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1593,47,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Demonstrate understanding of the sourcing process from a vendor perspective.','lo6. demonstrate understanding of the sourcing process from a vendor perspective.','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1594,47,'AS01','assessment',8,'Individual assignment II Reflective essay on in-class activities','Type: Written work. Description: Individual assignment II Reflective essay on in-class activities','type: written work. description: individual assignment ii reflective essay on in-class activities','assessment:AS01'),(1595,47,'AS02','assessment',9,'Case Study Presentation on a chosen case article','Type: Presentation. Description: Case Study Presentation on a chosen case article','type: presentation. description: case study presentation on a chosen case article','assessment:AS02'),(1596,47,'AS03','assessment',10,'Case study on IT Sourcing Decision Worksheet Presentation Complete in class','Type: Case studies. Description: Case study on IT Sourcing Decision Worksheet Presentation Complete in class','type: case studies. description: case study on it sourcing decision worksheet presentation complete in class','assessment:AS03'),(1597,47,'AS04','assessment',11,'Individual assignment I Develop an information systems sourcing plan','Type: Written work. Description: Individual assignment I Develop an information systems sourcing plan','type: written work. description: individual assignment i develop an information systems sourcing plan','assessment:AS04'),(1598,47,'AS05','assessment',12,'Group Report IS pitching plan as a vendor','Type: Written work. Description: Group Report IS pitching plan as a vendor','type: written work. description: group report is pitching plan as a vendor','assessment:AS05'),(1599,47,'AS06','assessment',13,'Video creation Marketing video for a chosen information system','Type: Creative work. Description: Video creation Marketing video for a chosen information system','type: creative work. description: video creation marketing video for a chosen information system','assessment:AS06'),(1600,47,'AD01','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 1','Individual Assessments','individual assessments','assessment_description:AD01'),(1601,47,'AD02','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 2','Individual Assignment I: Develop an information systems sourcing plan','individual assignment i: develop an information systems sourcing plan','assessment_description:AD02'),(1602,47,'AD03','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 3','Individual Assignment II: An reflective essay on in-class activities; consist of multiple components.','individual assignment ii: an reflective essay on in-class activities; consist of multiple components.','assessment_description:AD03'),(1603,47,'AD04','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 4','Group Assessments:','group assessments:','assessment_description:AD04'),(1604,47,'AD05','assessment_description',18,'Assessment description 5','Case Study Discussion: Every group presents one case study in class. The order is to be determined in class.','case study discussion: every group presents one case study in class. the order is to be determined in class.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1605,47,'AD06','assessment_description',19,'Assessment description 6','In-class Assessment: Work as a group to solve a sourcing decision making case study in class. Including worksheet and presentation.','in-class assessment: work as a group to solve a sourcing decision making case study in class. including worksheet and presentation.','assessment_description:AD06'),(1606,47,'AD07','assessment_description',20,'Assessment description 7','Group Project Report: Develop an IS pitching proposal as a vendor','group project report: develop an is pitching proposal as a vendor','assessment_description:AD07'),(1607,47,'AD08','assessment_description',21,'Assessment description 8','Group Project Video: Marketing/Pitching video for a chosen information systems.','group project video: marketing/pitching video for a chosen information systems.','assessment_description:AD08'),(1608,47,'AD09','assessment_description',22,'Assessment description 9','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD09'),(1609,47,'WK01','weekly_schedule',23,'Week 01: Introduction to IS sourcing','Introduction to IS sourcing. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','introduction to is sourcing. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1610,47,'WK02','weekly_schedule',24,'Week 02: Strategic Management and Information Systems','Strategic Management and Information Systems. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','strategic management and information systems. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1611,47,'WK03','weekly_schedule',25,'Week 03: IS Outsourcing Foundations','IS Outsourcing Foundations. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','is outsourcing foundations. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1612,47,'WK04','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 04: Business Process Analysis in IS Sourcing: BAM and CATWOE','Business Process Analysis in IS Sourcing: BAM and CATWOE. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','business process analysis in is sourcing: bam and catwoe. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1613,47,'WK05','weekly_schedule',27,'Week 05: Going to Market','Going to Market. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','going to market. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1614,47,'WK06','weekly_schedule',28,'Week 06: Evaluating Sourcing Options and Vendors','Evaluating Sourcing Options and Vendors. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','evaluating sourcing options and vendors. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1615,47,'WK07','weekly_schedule',29,'Week 07: Integrated Discussion of Sourcing Decision Making','Integrated Discussion of Sourcing Decision Making. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','integrated discussion of sourcing decision making. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1616,47,'WK08','weekly_schedule',30,'Week 08: Vendors\' perspectives','Vendors\' perspectives. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','vendors\' perspectives. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK08'),(1617,47,'WK09','weekly_schedule',31,'Week 09: Vendors\' perspectives','Vendors\' perspectives. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','vendors\' perspectives. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK09'),(1618,47,'WK10','weekly_schedule',32,'Week 10: FinOps: Financial Operations for Cloud Cost Optimization','FinOps: Financial Operations for Cloud Cost Optimization. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','finops: financial operations for cloud cost optimization. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK10'),(1619,47,'WK11','weekly_schedule',33,'Week 11: Sourcing Risks and Control Strategies','Sourcing Risks and Control Strategies. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','sourcing risks and control strategies. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(1620,47,'WK12','weekly_schedule',34,'Week 12: Managing Transition and Post-Sourcing Operations','Managing Transition and Post-Sourcing Operations. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','managing transition and post-sourcing operations. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1621,47,'WK13','weekly_schedule',35,'Week 13: Revision','Revision. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','revision. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1622,48,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','The disruptive forces of digital technologies require businesses to be in a constant state of change to stay competitive in turbulent markets. However, as companies need to maintain their current revenue streams, they need to progress through a series of digital transformation projects. In this unit students learn how to analyse an organisation within a local and global context and develop knowledge of techniques required for managing digital business transformation initiatives. Topics covered include: the drivers of digital business transformation, managing digital transformation as a process, understand the power of disruptive technologies, technological impacts on new forms of organizational arrangements.','the disruptive forces of digital technologies require businesses to be in a constant state of change to stay competitive in turbulent markets. however, as companies need to maintain their current revenue streams, they need to progress through a series of digital transformation projects. in this unit students learn how to analyse an organisation within a local and global context and develop knowledge of techniques required for managing digital business transformation initiatives. topics covered include: the drivers of digital business transformation, managing digital transformation as a process, understand the power of disruptive technologies, technological impacts on new forms of organizational arrangements.','overview:OV01'),(1623,48,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Identify and describe the drivers and enablers of digital transformation in business settings.','lo1. identify and describe the drivers and enablers of digital transformation in business settings.','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1624,48,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Critically analyse business problems that necessitate digital transformation and change in an organisation.','lo2. critically analyse business problems that necessitate digital transformation and change in an organisation.','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1625,48,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Critically and creatively analyse and propose business innovations to address identified business problems.','lo3. critically and creatively analyse and propose business innovations to address identified business problems.','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1626,48,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Critically analyse the challenges for businesses in the face of innovation and technological advancements.','lo4. critically analyse the challenges for businesses in the face of innovation and technological advancements.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1627,48,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Critically and creatively analyse various strategies to overcome challenges in digital transformation.','lo5. critically and creatively analyse various strategies to overcome challenges in digital transformation.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1628,48,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Critically synthesise and apply methods, models and frameworks with business analysis, communication and research skills in digital transformation projects.','lo6. critically synthesise and apply methods, models and frameworks with business analysis, communication and research skills in digital transformation projects.','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1629,48,'LO07','learning_outcome',8,'Learning outcome 7','LO7. Collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds.','lo7. collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds.','learning_outcome:LO07'),(1630,48,'LO08','learning_outcome',9,'Learning outcome 8','LO8. Contribute effectively as a responsible member of a diverse team for group assessments.','lo8. contribute effectively as a responsible member of a diverse team for group assessments.','learning_outcome:LO08'),(1631,48,'AS01','assessment',10,'Final Exam Written Exam','Type: Written exam. Description: Final Exam Written Exam','type: written exam. description: final exam written exam','assessment:AS01'),(1632,48,'AS02','assessment',11,'Assignment 1 Individual in-class presentation in week 5/6. This is a 90-second pitch accompanied by a one-page poster.','Type: Presentation. Description: Assignment 1 Individual in-class presentation in week 5/6. This is a 90-second pitch accompanied by a one-page poster.','type: presentation. description: assignment 1 individual in-class presentation in week 5/6. this is a 90-second pitch accompanied by a one-page poster.','assessment:AS02'),(1633,48,'AS03','assessment',12,'Assignment 2c Group presentation (In-class presentation Week 12/13)','Type: Presentation. Description: Assignment 2c Group presentation (In-class presentation Week 12/13)','type: presentation. description: assignment 2c group presentation (in-class presentation week 12/13)','assessment:AS03'),(1634,48,'AS04','assessment',13,'Assignment 2a Group report outline','Type: Case studies. Description: Assignment 2a Group report outline','type: case studies. description: assignment 2a group report outline','assessment:AS04'),(1635,48,'AS05','assessment',14,'Assignment 2b Business report and presentation slides','Type: Case studies. Description: Assignment 2b Business report and presentation slides','type: case studies. description: assignment 2b business report and presentation slides','assessment:AS05'),(1636,48,'AD01','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 1','• Assignment 1 (Executive Pitch and Q&A): Students will select a company that has undergone digital transformation and analyse recent news articles about the company. They will synthesise the key insights and evaluate the likely transformative impact of these developments, and communicate their analysis through a one-page poster and a 90-second executive pitch. Students will be encouraged to focus on an industry and company aligned with their future career interests. • Assignment 2a (Group Report Outline): Students will work in groups as a team of consultants to submit a structured outline for their Digital Transformation Management Plan for a selected company. The outline will present the company background and context, diagnose the need for digital transformation, and propose and briefly evaluate potential digital solutions. This submission is designed to support formative feedback from the teaching team, which groups should use to strengthen their final report and presentation.','• assignment 1 (executive pitch and q&a): students will select a company that has undergone digital transformation and analyse recent news articles about the company. they will synthesise the key insights and evaluate the likely transformative impact of these developments, and communicate their analysis through a one-page poster and a 90-second executive pitch. students will be encouraged to focus on an industry and company aligned with their future career interests. • assignment 2a (group report outline): students will work in groups as a team of consultants to submit a structured outline for their digital transformation management plan for a selected company. the outline will present the company background and context, diagnose the need for digital transformation, and propose and briefly evaluate potential digital solutions. this submission is designed to support formative feedback from the teaching team, which groups should use to strengthen their final report and presentation.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1637,48,'AD02','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 2','• Assignment 2b (Group Report & Presentation Slides): Students will work in groups to develop a professional business report that proposes a digital transformation solution for a selected organisation. Building on feedback from the proposal outline, the report should describe the solution in sufficient detail to show how it addresses the organisation’s challenges, and apply current change management frameworks to analyse the organisation and develop a transformative change management plan aligned with the solution and project requirements.','• assignment 2b (group report & presentation slides): students will work in groups to develop a professional business report that proposes a digital transformation solution for a selected organisation. building on feedback from the proposal outline, the report should describe the solution in sufficient detail to show how it addresses the organisation\'s challenges, and apply current change management frameworks to analyse the organisation and develop a transformative change management plan aligned with the solution and project requirements.','assessment_description:AD02'),(1638,48,'AD03','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 3','• Assignment 2c (In-class presentation): All students in each team to design, develop, and present the critical details from Assignment 2b (group report).','• assignment 2c (in-class presentation): all students in each team to design, develop, and present the critical details from assignment 2b (group report).','assessment_description:AD03'),(1639,48,'AD04','assessment_description',18,'Assessment description 4','• Final Exam: This exam will focus on the fundamental concepts and applied and experiential knowledge acquired across the semester. Note: This assessment will take the form of a supervised exam. It is a closed- book exam; no materials are allowed.','• final exam: this exam will focus on the fundamental concepts and applied and experiential knowledge acquired across the semester. note: this assessment will take the form of a supervised exam. it is a closed- book exam; no materials are allowed.','assessment_description:AD04'),(1640,48,'AD05','assessment_description',19,'Assessment description 5','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1641,48,'WK01','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 01: Introduction and Overview','Introduction and Overview. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','introduction and overview. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1642,48,'WK02','weekly_schedule',21,'Week 02: Understanding Disruption','Understanding Disruption. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','understanding disruption. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1643,48,'WK03','weekly_schedule',22,'Week 02: Understanding Disruption','Understanding Disruption. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','understanding disruption. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1644,48,'WK04','weekly_schedule',23,'Week 03: The Drivers and Enablers of Digital Transformation','The Drivers and Enablers of Digital Transformation. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','the drivers and enablers of digital transformation. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1645,48,'WK05','weekly_schedule',24,'Week 03: The Drivers and Enablers of Digital Transformation','The Drivers and Enablers of Digital Transformation. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','the drivers and enablers of digital transformation. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1646,48,'WK06','weekly_schedule',25,'Week 04: Manage Change and Transformation-1','Manage Change and Transformation-1. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','manage change and transformation-1. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1647,48,'WK07','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 04: Manage Change and Transformation-1','Manage Change and Transformation-1. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','manage change and transformation-1. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1648,48,'WK08','weekly_schedule',27,'Week 05: Manage Change and Transformation-2','Manage Change and Transformation-2. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','manage change and transformation-2. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK08'),(1649,48,'WK09','weekly_schedule',28,'Week 05: Manage Change and Transformation-2','Manage Change and Transformation-2. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','manage change and transformation-2. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK09'),(1650,48,'WK10','weekly_schedule',29,'Week 06: Overcome Challenges of Digital Transformation','Overcome Challenges of Digital Transformation. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','overcome challenges of digital transformation. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK10'),(1651,48,'WK11','weekly_schedule',30,'Week 06: Overcome Challenges of Digital Transformation','Overcome Challenges of Digital Transformation. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','overcome challenges of digital transformation. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(1652,48,'WK12','weekly_schedule',31,'Week 07: Digital Transformation of Consumption','Digital Transformation of Consumption. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','digital transformation of consumption. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1653,48,'WK13','weekly_schedule',32,'Week 07: Digital Transformation of Consumption','Digital Transformation of Consumption. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','digital transformation of consumption. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1654,48,'WK14','weekly_schedule',33,'Week 08: Digital Transformation of Communication','Digital Transformation of Communication. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','digital transformation of communication. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK14'),(1655,48,'WK15','weekly_schedule',34,'Week 08: Digital Transformation of Communication','Digital Transformation of Communication. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','digital transformation of communication. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK15'),(1656,48,'WK16','weekly_schedule',35,'Week 09: Digital Transformation of Traditional Industries','Digital Transformation of Traditional Industries. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','digital transformation of traditional industries. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK16'),(1657,48,'WK17','weekly_schedule',36,'Week 09: Digital Transformation of Traditional Industries','Digital Transformation of Traditional Industries. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','digital transformation of traditional industries. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK17'),(1658,48,'WK18','weekly_schedule',37,'Week 10: Group assignment consultation and self-directed learning','Group assignment consultation and self-directed learning. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','group assignment consultation and self-directed learning. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK18'),(1659,48,'WK19','weekly_schedule',38,'Week 10: Group assignment consultation and self-directed learning','Group assignment consultation and self-directed learning. Learning activity: Tutorial (1 hr)','group assignment consultation and self-directed learning. learning activity: tutorial (1 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK19'),(1660,48,'WK20','weekly_schedule',39,'Week 11: Review and Synthesis','Review and Synthesis. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','review and synthesis. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK20'),(1661,48,'WK21','weekly_schedule',40,'Week 12: Group Presentations','Group Presentations. Learning activity: Lecture (2 hr)','group presentations. learning activity: lecture (2 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK21'),(1662,48,'WK22','weekly_schedule',41,'Week 13: Group Presentations','Group Presentations. Learning activity: Lecture (3 hr)','group presentations. learning activity: lecture (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK22'),(1663,49,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','The unit provides an overall introduction to the different components of digital information infrastructures in organisational contexts. This includes organisational enterprise systems architecture, legacy systems, enterprise systems, cloud infrastructure and enabling technologies such as blockchain, internet of things, or web services. Strategic managerial issues that arise from the implementation, use, and security management of information infrastructures and enterprise systems are also covered. The unit utilises a combination of practical sessions with Enterprise Systems, such as SAP, and case study analyses to build a deep understanding of relevant topics.','the unit provides an overall introduction to the different components of digital information infrastructures in organisational contexts. this includes organisational enterprise systems architecture, legacy systems, enterprise systems, cloud infrastructure and enabling technologies such as blockchain, internet of things, or web services. strategic managerial issues that arise from the implementation, use, and security management of information infrastructures and enterprise systems are also covered. the unit utilises a combination of practical sessions with enterprise systems, such as sap, and case study analyses to build a deep understanding of relevant topics.','overview:OV01'),(1664,49,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. explore the strategic managerial issues that arise from the implementation and use of enterprise systems as a means of integrating data and standardising processes','lo1. explore the strategic managerial issues that arise from the implementation and use of enterprise systems as a means of integrating data and standardising processes','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1665,49,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. use an example enterprise system to gain hands-on competency in supporting key business processes','lo2. use an example enterprise system to gain hands-on competency in supporting key business processes','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1666,49,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. provide an overview of an enterprise system implementation solution which addresses key processes, data and organisational structures, and explain the reasons behind the solution','lo3. provide an overview of an enterprise system implementation solution which addresses key processes, data and organisational structures, and explain the reasons behind the solution','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1667,49,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. evaluate the place of enterprise systems in broader digital information infrastructure.','lo4. evaluate the place of enterprise systems in broader digital information infrastructure.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1668,49,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. evaluate in a critical manner the technical trends which may impact on future enterprise systems use','lo5. evaluate in a critical manner the technical trends which may impact on future enterprise systems use','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1669,49,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. present ideas and arguments effectively, deliver a comprehensive and integrated enterprise information infrastructure that reflects a collective effort from a professional project team','lo6. present ideas and arguments effectively, deliver a comprehensive and integrated enterprise information infrastructure that reflects a collective effort from a professional project team','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1670,49,'LO07','learning_outcome',8,'Learning outcome 7','LO7. apply the principles of IT resources management to effectively solve real-world problems.','lo7. apply the principles of it resources management to effectively solve real-world problems.','learning_outcome:LO07'),(1671,49,'AS01','assessment',9,'Final Exam Closed book exam','Type: Written exam. Description: Final Exam Closed book exam','type: written exam. description: final exam closed book exam','assessment:AS01'),(1672,49,'AS02','assessment',10,'Case Presentation Presentation on Case Study Articles','Type: Presentation. Description: Case Presentation Presentation on Case Study Articles','type: presentation. description: case presentation presentation on case study articles','assessment:AS02'),(1673,49,'AS03','assessment',11,'Individual Assignment Written report with specified questions','Type: Practical skill. Description: Individual Assignment Written report with specified questions','type: practical skill. description: individual assignment written report with specified questions','assessment:AS03'),(1674,49,'AS04','assessment',12,'Group project report Report','Type: Written work. Description: Group project report Report','type: written work. description: group project report report','assessment:AS04'),(1675,49,'AS05','assessment',13,'Group project presentation Report','Type: Presentation. Description: Group project presentation Report','type: presentation. description: group project presentation report','assessment:AS05'),(1676,49,'AD01','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 1','Individual assignment: The individual assignment consists of multiple components that may include the completion of tasks with SAP and a written report.','individual assignment: the individual assignment consists of multiple components that may include the completion of tasks with sap and a written report.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1677,49,'AD02','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 2','Group project: You must demonstrate an information infrastructure which explains the role of enterprise systems within that infrastructure, discusses organisational and change management issues, and examines the effect of new technological trends.','group project: you must demonstrate an information infrastructure which explains the role of enterprise systems within that infrastructure, discusses organisational and change management issues, and examines the effect of new technological trends.','assessment_description:AD02'),(1678,49,'AD03','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 3','Case presentation: Each group is scheduled for a 10-minute case presentation during different weeks. The goal of these presentations is to help the class better understand the case background.','case presentation: each group is scheduled for a 10-minute case presentation during different weeks. the goal of these presentations is to help the class better understand the case background.','assessment_description:AD03'),(1679,49,'AD04','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 4','Final exam: This is a closed-book exam and will assess your ability to demonstrate your understanding of all material covered in the unit of study.','final exam: this is a closed-book exam and will assess your ability to demonstrate your understanding of all material covered in the unit of study.','assessment_description:AD04'),(1680,49,'AD05','assessment_description',18,'Assessment description 5','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1681,49,'WK01','weekly_schedule',19,'Week 01: Introduction','Introduction. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','introduction. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1682,49,'WK02','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 02: Business Process and Enterprise Systems','Business Process and Enterprise Systems. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','business process and enterprise systems. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1683,49,'WK03','weekly_schedule',21,'Week 03: Enterprise Systems and Accounting Process I','Enterprise Systems and Accounting Process I. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','enterprise systems and accounting process i. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1684,49,'WK04','weekly_schedule',22,'Week 04: Enterprise Systems and Procurement Process I','Enterprise Systems and Procurement Process I. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','enterprise systems and procurement process i. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1685,49,'WK05','weekly_schedule',23,'Week 05: Enterprise Systems and Procurement Process II','Enterprise Systems and Procurement Process II. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','enterprise systems and procurement process ii. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1686,49,'WK06','weekly_schedule',24,'Week 06: Enterprise Systems and Lead to Cash Process','Enterprise Systems and Lead to Cash Process. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','enterprise systems and lead to cash process. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1687,49,'WK07','weekly_schedule',25,'Week 07: Integrated Discussion on Enterprise Systems','Integrated Discussion on Enterprise Systems. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','integrated discussion on enterprise systems. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1688,49,'WK08','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 08: Guest Lecture (TBC)','Guest Lecture (TBC). Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','guest lecture (tbc). learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK08'),(1689,49,'WK09','weekly_schedule',27,'Week 09: Cloud Computing and Enterprise Systems','Cloud Computing and Enterprise Systems. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','cloud computing and enterprise systems. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK09'),(1690,49,'WK10','weekly_schedule',28,'Week 10: Blockchain and IoT','Blockchain and IoT. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','blockchain and iot. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK10'),(1691,49,'WK11','weekly_schedule',29,'Week 11: Managing Digital Information Infrastructure I','Managing Digital Information Infrastructure I. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','managing digital information infrastructure i. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(1692,49,'WK12','weekly_schedule',30,'Week 12: Managing Digital Information Infrastructure II','Managing Digital Information Infrastructure II. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','managing digital information infrastructure ii. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1693,49,'WK13','weekly_schedule',31,'Week 13: Course Revision','Course Revision. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','course revision. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1694,50,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit highlights the key concepts of business process management (BPM) and their importance to organisations in supporting the business operations and providing opportunities for competitive advantage and innovation. It provides a detailed understanding of the concepts, strategies, tools and technologies required throughout the BPM lifecycle. This unit takes both the strategic and change management perspectives in designing process architecture and governance, as well as analysing, designing, and measuring performance of processes across value chains and aligned to industry standards. The unit also develops practical skills in modelling and simulating processes using business process management tools.','this unit highlights the key concepts of business process management (bpm) and their importance to organisations in supporting the business operations and providing opportunities for competitive advantage and innovation. it provides a detailed understanding of the concepts, strategies, tools and technologies required throughout the bpm lifecycle. this unit takes both the strategic and change management perspectives in designing process architecture and governance, as well as analysing, designing, and measuring performance of processes across value chains and aligned to industry standards. the unit also develops practical skills in modelling and simulating processes using business process management tools.','overview:OV01'),(1695,50,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Discuss the holistic role of Business Process Management (BPM) in a business environment to improve performance and align to overall strategy.','lo1. discuss the holistic role of business process management (bpm) in a business environment to improve performance and align to overall strategy.','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1696,50,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Apply BPM methodologies, concepts, and principles to business problems and practice following the BPM lifecycle.','lo2. apply bpm methodologies, concepts, and principles to business problems and practice following the bpm lifecycle.','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1697,50,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Address the issues and challenges associated with process change initiatives in organisations.','lo3. address the issues and challenges associated with process change initiatives in organisations.','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1698,50,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Evaluate the impact of process change projects on stakeholders and the role of change management in mitigating risks in such projects.','lo4. evaluate the impact of process change projects on stakeholders and the role of change management in mitigating risks in such projects.','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1699,50,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Use BPM tools to model, document, and analyse processes during the BPM lifecycle.','lo5. use bpm tools to model, document, and analyse processes during the bpm lifecycle.','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1700,50,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Work independently in a professional and ethical manner','lo6. work independently in a professional and ethical manner','learning_outcome:LO06'),(1701,50,'LO07','learning_outcome',8,'Learning outcome 7','LO7. Work as a responsible member of a diverse team, collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds.','lo7. work as a responsible member of a diverse team, collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds.','learning_outcome:LO07'),(1702,50,'AS01','assessment',9,'Final exam Written exam','Type: Written exam. Description: Final exam Written exam','type: written exam. description: final exam written exam','assessment:AS01'),(1703,50,'AS02','assessment',10,'Individual assignment Written submission','Type: Case studies. Description: Individual assignment Written submission','type: case studies. description: individual assignment written submission','assessment:AS02'),(1704,50,'AS03','assessment',11,'Business Proposal Business idea and execution plan proposal','Type: Creative work. Description: Business Proposal Business idea and execution plan proposal','type: creative work. description: business proposal business idea and execution plan proposal','assessment:AS03'),(1705,50,'AS04','assessment',12,'Business Report Group Report Submission','Type: Case studies. Description: Business Report Group Report Submission','type: case studies. description: business report group report submission','assessment:AS04'),(1706,50,'AD01','assessment_description',13,'Assessment description 1','Individual assignment: In this assignment students will take the role of the process analyst and engage in process discovery and analysis within a given business case context.','individual assignment: in this assignment students will take the role of the process analyst and engage in process discovery and analysis within a given business case context.','assessment_description:AD01'),(1707,50,'AD02','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 2','Business Proposal assignment: In this asignment students will analyse the market and identify new services for a business case seeking to expand. Students will propose a new service and a plan to guide the execution of the project.','business proposal assignment: in this asignment students will analyse the market and identify new services for a business case seeking to expand. students will propose a new service and a plan to guide the execution of the project.','assessment_description:AD02'),(1708,50,'AD03','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 3','Business Report assignment: In this assignment students will desing new processes following the service proposed in their Business Proposal pitch. Students will assess the feasibility of new processes, the resources required, and the challenges encountered during process implementation. Students will use Signavio (BPM tool) to document, simulate and analyse the new business processes.','business report assignment: in this assignment students will desing new processes following the service proposed in their business proposal pitch. students will assess the feasibility of new processes, the resources required, and the challenges encountered during process implementation. students will use signavio (bpm tool) to document, simulate and analyse the new business processes.','assessment_description:AD03'),(1709,50,'AD04','assessment_description',16,'Assessment description 4','Final exam: A supervised exam that will test students’ theoretical understanding, critical thinking, and ability to apply and evaluate BPM concepts and principles in practice.','final exam: a supervised exam that will test students\' theoretical understanding, critical thinking, and ability to apply and evaluate bpm concepts and principles in practice.','assessment_description:AD04'),(1710,50,'AD05','assessment_description',17,'Assessment description 5','Detailed information for each assessment can be found on Canvas.','detailed information for each assessment can be found on canvas.','assessment_description:AD05'),(1711,50,'WK01','weekly_schedule',18,'Week 01: Overview of Business Process Management (BPM)','Overview of Business Process Management (BPM). Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','overview of business process management (bpm). learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1712,50,'WK02','weekly_schedule',19,'Week 02: Process identification','Process identification. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','process identification. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1713,50,'WK03','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 03: Process governance and discovery','Process governance and discovery. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','process governance and discovery. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1714,50,'WK04','weekly_schedule',21,'Week 04: Process modelling 1: BPMN Notation','Process modelling 1: BPMN Notation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','process modelling 1: bpmn notation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1715,50,'WK05','weekly_schedule',22,'Week 05: Process modelling 2: Modelling As-Is processes using Signavio','Process modelling 2: Modelling As-Is processes using Signavio. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','process modelling 2: modelling as-is processes using signavio. learning activity: semi