project consultation','BPM emerging topics; Group project consultation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','bpm emerging topics; group project consultation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(1723,50,'WK13','weekly_schedule',30,'Week 13: Unit Review and Final Exam Preparation','Unit Review and Final Exam Preparation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','unit review and final exam preparation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(1724,51,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit develops knowledge and skills in innovative, digital business models and strategies from a management perspective. The unit facilitates a better understanding and application of the concepts, strategies, tools and technologies necessary for undertaking digital innovation of business models. From basic knowledge of digital business models and business processes, this unit increases awareness and understanding of stakeholders, their capabilities and their limitations in the strategic convergence of technology and business. It provides insights into the digital technologies required to support business in the 21st Century and supports development of student capabilities to analyse, develop and evaluate innovative digital business strategies and models.','this unit develops knowledge and skills in innovative, digital business models and strategies from a management perspective. the unit facilitates a better understanding and application of the concepts, strategies, tools and technologies necessary for undertaking digital innovation of business models. from basic knowledge of digital business models and business processes, this unit increases awareness and understanding of stakeholders, their capabilities and their limitations in the strategic convergence of technology and business. it provides insights into the digital technologies required to support business in the 21st century and supports development of student capabilities to analyse, develop and evaluate innovative digital business strategies and models.','overview:OV01'),(1725,51,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Demonstrate knowledge and understanding of characteristics of digital business','lo1. demonstrate knowledge and understanding of characteristics of digital business','learning_outcome:LO01'),(1726,51,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Effectively analyze and evaluate the strategy and business model of digital platforms','lo2. effectively analyze and evaluate the strategy and business model of digital platforms','learning_outcome:LO02'),(1727,51,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Demonstrate capabilities for critical analysis and creative design of practical digital business innovations','lo3. demonstrate capabilities for critical analysis and creative design of practical digital business innovations','learning_outcome:LO03'),(1728,51,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Critically assess the value and opportunities of emerging technologies for business innovations in different industries','lo4. critically assess the value and opportunities of emerging technologies for business innovations in different industries','learning_outcome:LO04'),(1729,51,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds','lo5. collaborate and communicate in a professional manner with people from diverse backgrounds','learning_outcome:LO05'),(1730,51,'AS01','assessment',7,'Individual reflective reports Individual reflective reports','Type: Portfolio or journal. Description: Individual reflective reports Individual reflective reports','type: portfolio or journal. description: individual reflective reports individual reflective reports','assessment:AS01'),(1731,51,'AS02','assessment',8,'Individual project Written report','Type: Written work. Description: Individual project Written report','