k to critically evaluate managerial practices','reflective essay: students will utilise a reflective framework to critically evaluate managerial practices','assessment_description:AD03'),(1766,52,'WK01','weekly_schedule',15,'Week 01: Foundational and historical concepts','Foundational and historical concepts. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','foundational and historical concepts. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(1767,52,'WK02','weekly_schedule',16,'Week 02: Decision making for managers','Decision making for managers. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','decision making for managers. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK02'),(1768,52,'WK03','weekly_schedule',17,'Week 03: Data quality','Data quality. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','data quality. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK03'),(1769,52,'WK04','weekly_schedule',18,'Week 04: Strategies & business models for valuecreation','Strategies & business models for valuecreation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','strategies & business models for valuecreation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK04'),(1770,52,'WK05','weekly_schedule',19,'Week 05: Strategic alignment and IT governance','Strategic alignment and IT governance. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','strategic alignment and it governance. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK05'),(1771,52,'WK06','weekly_schedule',20,'Week 06: Exam preparation','Exam preparation. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','exam preparation. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK06'),(1772,52,'WK07','weekly_schedule',21,'Week 07: Mid-semester Test','Mid-semester Test. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','mid-semester test. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK07'),(1773,52,'WK08','weekly_schedule',22,'Week 08: Analytics, people and culture','Analytics, people and culture. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','analytics, people and culture. learning activity