allenges [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','sustainability, responsibility and emerging challenges [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK22'),(2009,59,'WK23','weekly_schedule',45,'Week 12: Tailoring, Adaptive and Hybrid Project Management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]','Tailoring, Adaptive and Hybrid Project Management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','tailoring, adaptive and hybrid project management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK23'),(2010,59,'WK24','weekly_schedule',46,'Week 12: Tailoring, Adaptive and Hybrid Project Management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]','Tailoring, Adaptive and Hybrid Project Management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','tailoring, adaptive and hybrid project management [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK24'),(2011,59,'WK25','weekly_schedule',47,'Week 13: AI, PM Maturity and Professional Identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]','AI, PM Maturity and Professional Identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. Learning activity: Lecture (1.5 hr)','ai, pm maturity and professional identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. learning activity: lecture (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK25'),(2012,59,'WK26','weekly_schedule',48,'Week 13: AI, PM Maturity and Professional Identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]','AI, PM Maturity and Professional Identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. Learning activity: Tutorial (1.5 hr)','ai, pm maturity and professional identity [online recorded lecture + on-campus tutorial]. learning activity: tutorial (1.5 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK26'),(2013,60,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','Despite the widely acknowledged importance of data as a strategic resource, organisations continue to struggle with appropriately managing their data assets. This unit highlights the crucial importance of data governance in the administration, protection, and optimisation of data. It provides an exploration into the core principles of data governance, discusses the influence of emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, and examines the broader societal and ethical implications surrounding data. Through interactive case studies and hands-on assessments, students learn about the complex issues surrounding data governance and formulate and persuasively communicate practical data governance approaches to empower organisations to navigate their data landscape.','despite the widely acknowledged importance of data as a strategic resource, organisations continue to struggle with appropriately managing their data assets. this unit highlights the crucial importance of data governance in the administration, protection, and optimisation of data. it provides an exploration into the core principles of data governance, discusses the influence of emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, and examines the broader societal and ethical implications surrounding data. through interactive case studies and hands-on assessments, students learn about the complex issues surrounding data governance and formulate and persuasively communicate practical data governance approaches to empower organisations to navigate their data landscape.','overview:OV01'),(2014,60,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Discuss and apply the foundational principles and concepts of data governance, including stewardship, data quality, security, metadata, and lifecycle management','lo1. discuss and apply the foundational principles and concepts of data governance, including stewardship, data quality, security, metadata, and lifecycle management','learning_outcome:LO01'),(2015,60,'LO02','learning_outcome',3,'Learning outcome 2','LO2. Reflect critically on the implications of emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, blockchain, and internet of things, on data governance practices','lo2. reflect critically on the implications of emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, blockchain, and internet of things, on data governance practices','learning_outcome:LO02'),(2016,60,'LO03','learning_outcome',4,'Learning outcome 3','LO3. Analyze case studies of data governance practices in various (inter)organizational contexts to identify stakeholders, key success factors, challenges, and opportunities','lo3. analyze case studies of data governance practices in various (inter)organizational contexts to identify stakeholders, key success factors, challenges, and opportunities','learning_outcome:LO03'),(2017,60,'LO04','learning_outcome',5,'Learning outcome 4','LO4. Evaluate the broader societal and ethical implications surrounding data governance, including privacy and transparency, and propose and discuss the effectiveness of ethical guidelines','lo4. evaluate the broader societal and ethical implications surrounding data governance, including privacy and transparency, and propose and discuss the effectiveness of ethical guidelines','learning_outcome:LO04'),(2018,60,'LO05','learning_outcome',6,'Learning outcome 5','LO5. Assess how organizations can leverage digital data and become more data-driven to enhance decision-making processes','lo5. assess how organizations can leverage digital data and become more data-driven to enhance decision-making processes','learning_outcome:LO05'),(2019,60,'LO06','learning_outcome',7,'Learning outcome 6','LO6. Develop and present a comprehensive data governance strategy tailored to a specific case organization, integrating lecture materials, and ensuring alignment with the organizational context','lo6. develop and present a comprehensive data governance strategy tailored to a specific case organization, integrating lecture materials, and ensuring alignment with the organizational context','learning_outcome:LO06'),(2020,60,'AS01','assessment',8,'Individual Report A Please see detailed Individual Assignment requirements in Canvas.','Type: Written work. Description: Individual Report A Please see detailed Individual Assignment requirements in Canvas.','type: written work. description: individual report a please see detailed individual assignment requirements in canvas.','assessment:AS01'),(2021,60,'AS02','assessment',9,'Individual report B Part I Report B part I (750 words); marked for completeness. Failure to submit will affect the mark for Report B part II.','Type: Case studies. Description: Individual report B Part I Report B part I (750 words); marked for completeness. Failure to submit will affect the mark for Report B part II.','type: case studies. description: individual report b part i report b part i (750 words); marked for completeness. failure to submit will affect the mark for report b part ii.','assessment:AS02'),(2022,60,'AS03','assessment',10,'Individual Report B Part II Full report after a mandatory in-class assignment in week 9. Failure to attend in class in week 9 will prohibit the student from being able to submit this report. Further assignment requirements in Canvas.','Type: Case studies. Description: Individual Report B Part II Full report after a mandatory in-class assignment in week 9. Failure to attend in class in week 9 will prohibit the student from being able to submit this report. Further assignment requirements in Canvas.','type: case studies. description: individual report b part ii full report after a mandatory in-class assignment in week 9. failure to attend in class in week 9 will prohibit the student from being able to submit this report. further assignment requirements in canvas.','assessment:AS03'),(2023,60,'AS04','assessment',11,'Group project pitch Pitch of data strategy','Type: Presentation. Description: Group project pitch Pitch of data strategy','type: presentation. description: group project pitch pitch of data strategy','assessment:AS04'),(2024,60,'AS05','assessment',12,'Group project report Full report with formative submissions throughout the semester. See Canvas for full details.','Type: Written work. Description: Group project report Full report with formative submissions throughout the semester. See Canvas for full details.','type: written work. description: group project report full report with formative submissions throughout the semester. see canvas for full details.','assessment:AS05'),(2025,60,'AD01','assessment_description',13,'Assessment description 1','Group project report and pitch: The group project is an applied assignment that requires the team\'s development of a data strategy.','group project report and pitch: the group project is an applied assignment that requires the team\'s development of a data strategy.','assessment_description:AD01'),(2026,60,'AD02','assessment_description',14,'Assessment description 2','Individual Assignment A: The report will assess the implications of generative AI for data governance.','individual assignment a: the report will assess the implications of generative ai for data governance.','assessment_description:AD02'),(2027,60,'AD03','assessment_description',15,'Assessment description 3','Individual Assignment B: The report will explore decision-making with data in complex organizational settings.','individual assignment b: the report will explore decision-making with data in complex organizational settings.','assessment_description:AD03'),(2028,60,'WK01','weekly_schedule',16,'Week 01: Introduction and overview','Introduction and overview. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','introduction and overview. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK01'),(2029,60,'WK02','weekly_schedule',17,'Week 02: Introduction to data governance','Introduction to data governance. Learning activity: S