2038,60,'WK11','weekly_schedule',26,'Week 11: Managing and sustaining change','Managing and sustaining change. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','managing and sustaining change. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK11'),(2039,60,'WK12','weekly_schedule',27,'Week 12: Guest lecture, review and synthesis','Guest lecture, review and synthesis. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','guest lecture, review and synthesis. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK12'),(2040,60,'WK13','weekly_schedule',28,'Week 13: Group pitches','Group pitches. Learning activity: Seminar (3 hr)','group pitches. learning activity: seminar (3 hr)','weekly_schedule:WK13'),(2041,61,'OV01','overview',1,'Overview paragraph 1','This unit bridges the gap between theory and practice by integrating the knowledge and key skills developed across the Digital Business or Business Information Systems specialisation. It provides students with a practical teamwork experience to identify, analyse, and solve contemporary problems by exploring the socio-technical ecosystem in which a digital business operates. This experiential learning opportunity enhances students’ career-readiness by consolidating their professional skills and ability to apply the Business Information Systems knowledge in authentic situations.','this unit bridges the gap between theory and practice by integrating the knowledge and key skills developed across the digital business or business information systems specialisation. it provides students with a practical teamwork experience to identify, analyse, and solve contemporary problems by exploring the socio-technical ecosystem in which a digital business operates. this experiential learning opportunity enhances students\' career-readiness by consolidating their professional skills and ability to apply the business information systems knowledge in authentic situations.','overview:OV01'),(2042,61,'LO01','learning_outcome',2,'Learning outcome 1','LO1. Apply advanced